    "updated_at": "2022-06-15T02:31:58Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the correction. I see\r\n\r\n\"Apart from these restrictions, this standard does not specify when user agents should discard an entry's [document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#she-document), versus keeping it cached.\"\r\n\r\nThis sentence here is odd. I guess we have never specced an eviction case yet but that makes it sound like we won't (as opposed to coincidentally just haven't yet).",
