    "body": "Yeah I don't think anything currently specs eviction that happen after unload steps. In addition to updating the note, I think we should also add a hook to spec eviction that other specs can refer to (that can be called with just the document, so the callers don't need to find the relevant entries that needs to have their document nulled out?)",
