    "updated_at": "2025-02-03T10:39:43Z",
    "body": "Is this discussion also relevant for other mechanism that can queue tasks to a not fully active document in the bfcache? For example [`concept-storage-broadcast`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webstorage.html#concept-storage-broadcast) seems like a candidate. \n\n(by the way the note seems incorrect: it reads \"events fired on such objects are ignored by the event loop\", but I think it is rather the task that is not [runnable](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#concept-task-runnable)). ",
