    "created_at": "2025-02-04T06:02:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-04T06:02:46Z",
    "body": "Chrome has completed rolling out our change to allow pages with BC to enter BFCache but evicting them if a message is received. What we found is that navigations blocked by BC as a fraction of all history navigations have dropped from 2.4276% to 0.18%.\n\nWe don't have stats on what would happen if we queued 1 or more messages to be delivered after restore and it's unlikely we will put the effort in to measuring that as 0.18%.\n\nThe strategy of caching and evicting on-message preserves correctness and while gaining most of the available performance benefit. I'd like to standardize on that.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
